## 2. QCI hierarchy and RBAC (build contract)

### 2.1 Principles
- Reporting tree via `users.manager_id`. Approvals flow **N+1 then N+2**.
- **Project Manager and above** may create institutional drafts.
- Below PM: published/read in assigned vertical unless delegated.
- **Secretary General (Chakravarthy T. Kannan):** apex observer, global read, optional override.
- **System Admin (Prabhav Kumar Singh):** full visibility + admin ops (`is_admin=true`); not default business approver.

### 2.2 Role matrix

| Tier | Designations | CFC role | SuperDoc role | Default mode | Create | L1 | L2 | Visibility |
|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|---|
| 0 Apex | Secretary General | `apex` | `viewer` (elevate on request) | `viewing` + markup | No* | Override | Override | Global |
| 0 Admin | System Admin | `admin` | ops `editor` when needed | `viewing` | Ops only | Admin override | Admin override | Global |
| 1 Executive | ASG, CEO, CTO, CFO, PA, SD, Director, JD, GL | `l2_approver` | `suggester` | `suggesting` | Yes | If N+1 | Yes (subtree) | Subtree |
| 2 SPM/DD/AD | Senior Project Manager, Deputy/Assistant Director | `l1_approver` | `suggester` | `suggesting` | Yes | Yes | No** | Team |
| 3 PM | Project Manager | `maker` | `editor` | `editing` | Yes | No | No | Own + assigned |
| 4 Staff | Analyst, AM, Coordinator, Trainee | `reader` | `viewer` | `viewing` | No | No | No | Assigned published |

\*Delegation exception allowed and audited.  
\**Unless the same person is also L2 in chain.

### 2.3 Demo reporting spine
```
SG: Chakravarthy T. Kannan
  └─ PA: Subroto Ghosh
       └─ SPM / L1: Aashna Arora
            └─ PM / Maker: Arpit Mathur
                 └─ Analyst + Admin flag: Prabhav Kumar Singh
```

### 2.4 Approval state machine × SuperDoc

| Status | Actor | SuperDoc behavior |
|---|---|---|
| `DRAFT` | Maker | `editing`; versioned saves; agent direct or tracked (toggle) |
| `PENDING_L1_REVIEW` | L1 | Maker locked/`viewing`; L1 `suggesting`; reject needs anchored comments |
| `APPROVED_L1_PENDING_L2` | L2 | L2 `suggesting` |
| `FINAL_APPROVED` | System | Hard lock; clean export; publish to archive; SHA-256 seal |
| `REJECTED` | Maker | Back to `editing` + threads + diff vs submitted version |
| `CHANGES_REQUESTED` | Maker | Soft reject; threads remain open |

**Server issues Document Session Tokens.** Client cannot self-upgrade mode/role.

