## 9. Acceptance criteria (FINAL MVP)

1. Hierarchy ACL prevents out-of-tree approval; PM cannot self-FINAL.
2. Session token enforces SuperDoc mode; tampered client cannot illegal-save.
3. DOCX round-trip survives MS Word open with headers/tables/lists.
4. Maker→L1→L2→FINAL works on one WO extension with redlines retained internally.
5. Agent draft generation cites ACL-visible corpus only.
6. FINAL export clean; internal review version retained; SHA-256 stored.
7. No document bytes sent to SuperDoc cloud (self-hosted only).
8. Demo path under ~10 minutes for leadership personas.

